00:19:44.420 --> 00:19:45.820
Grandpa!

00:19:46.150 --> 00:19:48.780
This is too cruel!

00:19:51.860 --> 00:19:53.890
She'll forget in time.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.140
Probably.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:20:00.870
But we won't be able to forget!

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:06.710
We hid ourselves
for the good of your future.

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:11.660
But we've always been watching over you.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:15.280
So, Natsumi, you're not alone.

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:18.960
Never were...

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.390
Never will be!

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:55.100
That apartment was cursed after all!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.390
Hiro, you went and--

00:21:06.400 --> 00:21:07.420
My eyes!

00:21:07.420 --> 00:21:09.590
We'll be taking these back.

00:21:14.700 --> 00:21:18.240
Hello. It's been a long time.

00:21:22.890 --> 00:21:25.230
No deposit or key money necessary.

00:21:25.230 --> 00:21:29.650
But, mess the place up and
you'll be paying the renovation costs.

00:21:29.650 --> 00:21:30.650
Okay!

00:21:30.650 --> 00:21:32.280
And another thing,

00:21:32.280 --> 00:21:36.450
be on your best behavior
when the landlord shows up. Got it?

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.450
Okay, you got it!

00:21:38.450 --> 00:21:42.500
Come on, let me live here, too.

00:21:42.500 --> 00:21:46.750
No way! You never take out
the trash or clean!

00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:52.730
This is an apartment where
<i>yokai</i> can live and be lively!

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:56.850
